WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.387 --> 00:00:03.482
打开Agent并建立Chat / Open Agent and create a Chat

2
00:00:03.482 --> 00:00:06.519
明确选择Ask / Explicitly choose Ask

3
00:00:06.519 --> 00:00:09.633
请求暂停后继续解释 / Ask to pause Recording and then continue explaining

4
00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:12.731
允许已明确的暂停操作 / Allow the explicit pause operation

5
00:00:12.731 --> 00:00:15.785
Stop模型回复不撤销已完成的Tool / Stop the response without undoing the completed Tool

6
00:00:15.785 --> 00:00:18.860
Retry本次只继续解释 / Retry with explanation only in this example

7
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.066
重新明确只读目标 / Restate a read-only goal

8
00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:25.286
执行真实Diagnostics Recent查询 / Execute a real Diagnostics Recent query

9
00:00:25.286 --> 00:00:28.444
用刚返回的traceId查询关联记录 / Query related records using the returned traceId

10
00:00:28.444 --> 00:00:41.719
请求需要审批的Diagnostics导出 / Request a Diagnostics export requiring approval

11
00:00:41.719 --> 00:00:45.041
审批后仍需真实Save窗口 / Approval still leads to a real Save window

12
00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:49.672
取消原生保存而不是伪造返回值 / Cancel native saving without replacing its return value

13
00:00:49.672 --> 00:01:02.057
重新发起并检查参数 / Request export again and review parameters

14
00:01:02.057 --> 00:01:06.407
保存guide-agent-diagnostics.jsonl / Save guide-agent-diagnostics.jsonl

15
00:01:06.407 --> 00:01:09.384
区分任务已开始与完成 / Distinguish a started job from completion

16
00:01:09.384 --> 00:01:12.558
查询实际文件任务直到完成 / Query the actual file task for completion

17
00:01:12.558 --> 00:01:15.493
保留暂停状态并核对实际结果 / Retain the paused state and verify the actual result
